        "id": "create-a-text-based-adventure-game-with-llama",
        "title": "使用 Llama 创建文字冒险游戏",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/create-a-text-based-adventure-game-with-llama/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "除了使用 Gradio 设置游戏界面外，当按下「New Game」按钮时，关于游戏背景和规则的指令会发送给 LLM。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "create-a-text-based-adventure-game-with-llama",
        "title": "使用 Llama 创建文字冒险游戏",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/create-a-text-based-adventure-game-with-llama/"
      }
    },
    {
