        "type": "post",
        "id": "create-a-text-based-adventure-game-with-llama",
        "title": "使用 Llama 创建文字冒险游戏",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/create-a-text-based-adventure-game-with-llama/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "你能向我们揭示古老的神器和法术藏在哪里吗？」",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "create-a-text-based-adventure-game-with-llama",
        "title": "使用 Llama 创建文字冒险游戏",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/create-a-text-based-adventure-game-with-llama/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "树木似乎在搅动，它们的树叶轻轻沙沙作响，仿佛它们在互相交流。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "create-a-text-based-adventure-game-with-llama",
        "title": "使用 Llama 创建文字冒险游戏",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/create-a-text-based-adventure-game-with-llama/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "然后，它们齐声低语：",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "create-a-text-based-adventure-game-with-llama",
        "title": "使用 Llama 创建文字冒险游戏",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/create-a-text-based-adventure-game-with-llama/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "「寻找古老橡树的神谕，在森林的深处。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "create-a-text-based-adventure-game-with-llama",
        "title": "使用 Llama 创建文字冒险游戏",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/create-a-text-based-adventure-game-with-llama/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "在那里，过去的秘密等待着你。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "create-a-text-based-adventure-game-with-llama",
        "title": "使用 Llama 创建文字冒险游戏",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/create-a-text-based-adventure-game-with-llama/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "但要小心，因为道路险恶，魔王的爪牙潜伏在阴影中。」",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "create-a-text-based-adventure-game-with-llama",
        "title": "使用 Llama 创建文字冒险游戏",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/create-a-text-based-adventure-game-with-llama/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "**故事进度：** 6↵**危机上升：** 1（树木的警告表明前方有危险。）↵**技术创新：** 对与自然进行魔法交流的基本理解",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "create-a-text-based-adventure-game-with-llama",
        "title": "使用 Llama 创建文字冒险游戏",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/create-a-text-based-adventure-game-with-llama/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "你从低语之林获得了宝贵的信息！",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "create-a-text-based-adventure-game-with-llama",
        "title": "使用 Llama 创建文字冒险游戏",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/create-a-text-based-adventure-game-with-llama/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "然而，你现在知道旅程将充满危险。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "create-a-text-based-adventure-game-with-llama",
        "title": "使用 Llama 创建文字冒险游戏",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/create-a-text-based-adventure-game-with-llama/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "你接下来想做什么？",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "create-a-text-based-adventure-game-with-llama",
        "title": "使用 Llama 创建文字冒险游戏",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/create-a-text-based-adventure-game-with-llama/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "你想前往古老橡树的神谕，还是探索森林的其他部分寻找线索和资源？",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "create-a-text-based-adventure-game-with-llama",
        "title": "使用 Llama 创建文字冒险游戏",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/create-a-text-based-adventure-game-with-llama/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "或者你想寻求 Akira 的指导，了解如何继续？",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "create-a-text-based-adventure-game-with-llama",
        "title": "使用 Llama 创建文字冒险游戏",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/create-a-text-based-adventure-game-with-llama/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "请响应你的想法，我会继续冒险！↵ </div><!-- message -->↵ </div><!-- person a -->↵ ↵<div class=\"person-b\">↵<div class=\"message\">↵Akira，请带我们去森林的深处。↵ </div><!-- message -->↵ </div><!-- person b -->↵ <div class=\"person-a\">↵ <div class=\"icon1\"></div>↵ <div class=\"message\">↵**森林小径：** +↵Akira 点点头，脸上带着坚定的表情。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "create-a-text-based-adventure-game-with-llama",
        "title": "使用 Llama 创建文字冒险游戏",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/create-a-text-based-adventure-game-with-llama/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "她沿着一条蜿蜒的小径带领你，熟练地穿过茂密的植被。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "create-a-text-based-adventure-game-with-llama",
        "title": "使用 Llama 创建文字冒险游戏",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/create-a-text-based-adventure-game-with-llama/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "这里的树木长得更高更密，在森林地面上投下斑驳的阴影。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "create-a-text-based-adventure-game-with-llama",
        "title": "使用 Llama 创建文字冒险游戏",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/create-a-text-based-adventure-game-with-llama/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "当你行走时，空气中弥漫着一股超凡脱俗的能量。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "create-a-text-based-adventure-game-with-llama",
        "title": "使用 Llama 创建文字冒险游戏",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/create-a-text-based-adventure-game-with-llama/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "你能感受到古老魔法的力量从土地本身散发出来。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "create-a-text-based-adventure-game-with-llama",
        "title": "使用 Llama 创建文字冒险游戏",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/create-a-text-based-adventure-game-with-llama/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Akira 停下来，眼睛盯着前方的某个东西。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "create-a-text-based-adventure-game-with-llama",
        "title": "使用 Llama 创建文字冒险游戏",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/create-a-text-based-adventure-game-with-llama/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "她低声说：「神谕的树林就在附近。」",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "create-a-text-based-adventure-game-with-llama",
        "title": "使用 Llama 创建文字冒险游戏",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/create-a-text-based-adventure-game-with-llama/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "**古老橡树林：** +↵你穿过一帘藤蔓，进入一片被高耸的树木环绕的空地。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "create-a-text-based-adventure-game-with-llama",
        "title": "使用 Llama 创建文字冒险游戏",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/create-a-text-based-adventure-game-with-llama/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "中心矗立着一棵巨大的橡树，它的树皮因年代久远而扭曲。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "create-a-text-based-adventure-game-with-llama",
        "title": "使用 Llama 创建文字冒险游戏",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/create-a-text-based-adventure-game-with-llama/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "空气中弥漫着古老智慧的气息。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "create-a-text-based-adventure-game-with-llama",
        "title": "使用 Llama 创建文字冒险游戏",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/create-a-text-based-adventure-game-with-llama/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Akira 走近树木，双手伸出，仿佛在表示敬意。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "create-a-text-based-adventure-game-with-llama",
        "title": "使用 Llama 创建文字冒险游戏",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/create-a-text-based-adventure-game-with-llama/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "她开始轻声吟唱，你周围的空气似乎随着能量振动。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "create-a-text-based-adventure-game-with-llama",
        "title": "使用 Llama 创建文字冒险游戏",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/create-a-text-based-adventure-game-with-llama/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "突然，一个全息影像在你面前具体化：一个飘渺的虚幻身影，眼睛像星星一样燃烧。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "create-a-text-based-adventure-game-with-llama",
        "title": "使用 Llama 创建文字冒险游戏",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/create-a-text-based-adventure-game-with-llama/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "**神谕的幻象：** +↵神谕用一个在你脑海中回响的声音说话：「在水晶洞穴的深处寻找光之基石。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "create-a-text-based-adventure-game-with-llama",
        "title": "使用 Llama 创建文字冒险游戏",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/create-a-text-based-adventure-game-with-llama/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "但要小心，因为道路充满了险恶的幻象和古老的守护者。」",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "create-a-text-based-adventure-game-with-llama",
        "title": "使用 Llama 创建文字冒险游戏",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/create-a-text-based-adventure-game-with-llama/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "幻象消失了，留给你的问题比答案还多。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "create-a-text-based-adventure-game-with-llama",
        "title": "使用 Llama 创建文字冒险游戏",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/create-a-text-based-adventure-game-with-llama/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "你接下来想做什么？",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "create-a-text-based-adventure-game-with-llama",
        "title": "使用 Llama 创建文字冒险游戏",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/create-a-text-based-adventure-game-with-llama/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "你要：↵A) 出发寻找水晶洞穴↵B) 询问 Akira 关于光之基石及其意义↵C) 探索周围的森林寻找线索和资源",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "create-a-text-based-adventure-game-with-llama",
        "title": "使用 Llama 创建文字冒险游戏",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/create-a-text-based-adventure-game-with-llama/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "请响应你的选择。↵ </div><!-- message -->↵ </div><!-- person a -->↵</div><!-- box -->",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "create-a-text-based-adventure-game-with-llama",
        "title": "使用 Llama 创建文字冒险游戏",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/create-a-text-based-adventure-game-with-llama/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "游戏开始崩溃。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "create-a-text-based-adventure-game-with-llama",
        "title": "使用 Llama 创建文字冒险游戏",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/create-a-text-based-adventure-game-with-llama/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "它不再响应故事进度，而是响应多项选择，与之前的响应不同。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "create-a-text-based-adventure-game-with-llama",
        "title": "使用 Llama 创建文字冒险游戏",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/create-a-text-based-adventure-game-with-llama/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "这是因为聊天历史已经达到 8k 个 token，这是模型一次可以处理的最大 token 数量。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "create-a-text-based-adventure-game-with-llama",
        "title": "使用 Llama 创建文字冒险游戏",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/create-a-text-based-adventure-game-with-llama/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "我们如何解决这个问题？",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "create-a-text-based-adventure-game-with-llama",
        "title": "使用 Llama 创建文字冒险游戏",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/create-a-text-based-adventure-game-with-llama/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "我们可以使用支持更多上下文的不同模型吗？",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "create-a-text-based-adventure-game-with-llama",
        "title": "使用 Llama 创建文字冒险游戏",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/create-a-text-based-adventure-game-with-llama/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "还是我们应该总结故事进度，然后将其传递给模型？",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "create-a-text-based-adventure-game-with-llama",
        "title": "使用 Llama 创建文字冒险游戏",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/create-a-text-based-adventure-game-with-llama/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "这是你真正的冒险了！",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "create-a-text-based-adventure-game-with-llama",
        "title": "使用 Llama 创建文字冒险游戏",
